WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:11.068
In tutorial 5.6, you'll decide how
much Alaventra does on its own,

00:00:11.118 --> 00:00:13.207
and which day your weekly work runs.

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:19.029
First, open Website settings in the
sidebar, then click the Autopilot tab.

00:00:21.226 --> 00:00:23.176
Now choose one of three levels.

00:00:23.226 --> 00:00:27.151
Only my keywords writes pages
just for the keywords you choose.

00:00:27.201 --> 00:00:29.272
Everything else waits for your OK.

00:00:30.277 --> 00:00:35.452
My keywords and keep my pages healthy also
refreshes your own pages when they lose

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:38.156
visitors. It's the recommended level.

00:00:39.166 --> 00:00:43.091
Full autopilot also picks new
topics and keywords for you,

00:00:43.141 --> 00:00:45.633
and tells you two days
before anything starts.

00:00:47.099 --> 00:00:50.124
Each card shows about how
many credits it uses a month.

00:00:50.174 --> 00:00:52.439
Pick one, then click Save level.

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:58.270
If new keyword ladders are set
to Manual in Pipeline settings,

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:03.695
saving Full autopilot opens Check this
first: nothing would be written on its own.

00:01:03.745 --> 00:01:06.488
Click Make new ladders Auto, or Cancel.

00:01:07.512 --> 00:01:12.122
Next, Your week shows your next weekly
run, when the Coming up plan arrives,

00:01:12.172 --> 00:01:13.744
and when the monthly checks run.

00:01:15.983 --> 00:01:20.498
To move your week, choose a day under Move
your week to, and click Change weekday.

00:01:20.548 --> 00:01:22.387
Your next run moves to that day.

00:01:24.962 --> 00:01:29.641
You'll find the same card on your Pipeline,
with each step of your last weekly run.

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:36.216
Now Alaventra does as much as you
want, on the day that suits you,

00:01:36.266 --> 00:01:39.030
and you still see every
page in Coming up first.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:43.285
So: open the Autopilot
tab, choose your level,

00:01:43.335 --> 00:01:45.226
and move your week to the day you want.

00:01:47.039 --> 00:01:53.783
Your autopilot is set. Next, answer a
keyword Alaventra suggests, in tutorial 5.7.
